WEBVTT

00:02.570 --> 00:06.050
I'll give birth to you once more.

00:07.140 --> 00:09.860
I'll make sure you'll never die this time.

00:10.820 --> 00:14.130
I'll make sure you'll never 
be broken this time.

00:15.150 --> 00:17.620
By sharing my power with you.

00:19.380 --> 00:24.130
Oh, but if I grant it to you all at once,

00:24.130 --> 00:26.430
you might not be able to endure it.

00:27.330 --> 00:30.210
So I'll make it so you're able to take it in

00:30.210 --> 00:32.930
little by little by little.

00:33.610 --> 00:35.110
And to do that...

00:35.770 --> 00:37.970
I'll spread my seeds throughout the world.

00:38.910 --> 00:43.980
Someday your human body will eventually 
be able to accept that power.

00:45.130 --> 00:49.190
Then you'll just need to absorb 
that power one by one.

00:51.370 --> 00:54.100
Once you've obtained all that power,

00:54.100 --> 00:56.290
then you'll remember everything,

00:56.710 --> 01:02.140
and this time we'll be able 
to be live together forever.

02:45.810 --> 02:49.260
Kurumi Tokisaki, I'm grateful to you.

02:49.260 --> 02:53.400
You truly were my wonderful friend 
until the very end.

03:05.450 --> 03:06.780
Zaphkiel!

03:10.730 --> 03:13.780
I'm sorry, Kurumi Tokisaki.

03:13.780 --> 03:15.650
Also, thank you.

03:15.650 --> 03:20.670
I'm able to stand before him 
once more thanks to you.

03:21.180 --> 03:23.100
How dare you?

03:26.290 --> 03:29.500
Shido, run.

03:56.470 --> 03:58.000
It's been a long time.

03:58.000 --> 04:00.340
We finally meet again, Shin.

04:00.340 --> 04:01.340
Shin?

04:09.170 --> 04:11.070
Have you remembered for me?

04:12.590 --> 04:13.550
Mio!

04:15.400 --> 04:16.400
Wha?!

04:20.120 --> 04:24.140
Kurumi Tokisaki's life signs have vanished.

04:24.140 --> 04:26.160
It looks like she's completely dead.

04:26.160 --> 04:29.490
Wh-What on earth is that?

04:31.230 --> 04:32.160
Reine?

04:39.220 --> 04:42.850
Please, reject my stupid thought 
like you always do.

04:43.290 --> 04:46.980
Reine, chastise me like you always do!

04:48.430 --> 04:52.560
Kotori, you really are a smart girl.

04:55.560 --> 04:56.810
MARIA!

05:01.660 --> 05:03.820
I'm grateful, Kotori.

05:04.340 --> 05:05.570
What for?

05:05.570 --> 05:07.940
I owe you one.

05:07.940 --> 05:10.380
You've been protecting Shin all this time,

05:10.380 --> 05:12.080
and I'm truly grateful for that.

05:12.450 --> 05:15.210
Reine, who on earth are you?

05:15.940 --> 05:21.460
I'm sure the answer isn't that far 
from what you're already imagining.

05:21.840 --> 05:25.220
That is me, and I am that.

05:25.780 --> 05:28.060
We're one will in two bodies.

05:28.930 --> 05:31.620
There was work I had to do on this end, too.

05:32.050 --> 05:34.750
So it was more convenient to split myself.

05:35.430 --> 05:39.100
Especially when granting everyone Sephirah.

05:39.100 --> 05:41.620
Granting Sephirah?

05:41.620 --> 05:43.610
Then you're Phantom?!

05:44.050 --> 05:48.450
Yes, and I am also the Spirit 
of Origin Kurumi mentioned.

05:49.150 --> 05:53.070
Kotori, the time I spent with you was fun.

05:53.630 --> 05:55.660
But that's over now.

05:55.660 --> 05:56.500
What?!

05:57.500 --> 05:58.620
Reine!

06:10.550 --> 06:13.510
Everyone, continue the mission.

06:14.020 --> 06:17.540
We've lost one ally and gained one enemy.

06:17.540 --> 06:19.140
That's all.

06:19.500 --> 06:23.200
<i>Oh? You recovered quickly.</i>

06:23.200 --> 06:25.660
<i>I'm handling control of the ship,</i>

06:25.660 --> 06:28.650
<i>so you could have remained 
depressed a little longer.</i>

06:28.650 --> 06:29.850
Hmph.

06:29.850 --> 06:33.650
If you're trying to light a fire under me, 
then do a better job of it.

06:33.650 --> 06:35.290
Pardon me then.

06:35.290 --> 06:39.670
It seems I still have room to learn about 
the intricacies of the human heart.

06:44.550 --> 06:46.320
Reine?!

06:46.320 --> 06:48.290
It's all right, Shin.

07:17.740 --> 07:18.710
Mio...

07:19.760 --> 07:23.210
Shin, have you remembered for me?

07:23.570 --> 07:26.210
I've missed you for so long.

07:26.210 --> 07:29.170
I wanted to see you for so, so long.

07:29.670 --> 07:33.500
I've lived this long entirely for that feeling.

07:36.530 --> 07:39.450
There's so much I want to share with you.

07:39.900 --> 07:43.340
There's so much 
I haven't been able to say to you.

07:44.150 --> 07:46.840
Ahh, but it's okay.

07:46.840 --> 07:50.820
This time, we'll be together forever, Shin.

07:50.820 --> 07:54.830
I'm... happy to see you, too, Mio.

07:54.830 --> 07:55.990
Shin!

07:55.990 --> 08:00.460
I'm sorry I left you alone for so long 
and made you feel so lonely.

08:01.070 --> 08:04.630
I truly am sorry I died before you.

08:04.980 --> 08:06.180
Don't be.

08:06.180 --> 08:07.410
It's nothing for you to apologize for—

08:07.410 --> 08:08.000
But...

08:08.450 --> 08:09.950
What is all this?

08:10.450 --> 08:16.760
What on earth have you done 
in order to revive me, Shinji Takamiya?

08:17.060 --> 08:18.240
Whatever it took.

08:18.760 --> 08:20.700
I did anything I had to.

08:20.700 --> 08:24.900
I did everything I needed to in order 
to see you one more time, Shin.

08:27.400 --> 08:29.780
Shin? Are you okay?

08:31.620 --> 08:33.900
Mio... No.

08:33.900 --> 08:34.780
Huh?

08:35.080 --> 08:39.640
No... You can't do that.

08:39.640 --> 08:43.540
You can't sacrifice others, 
no matter what your goal is.

08:44.330 --> 08:46.650
Yeah, you're right.

08:46.650 --> 08:50.300
But then what was I supposed to do?

08:50.710 --> 08:53.010
You were the only one for me.

08:53.500 --> 08:56.680
After losing you, 
I had no more reason to live, Shin.

08:57.130 --> 09:00.430
But I'm not weak like humans are.

09:00.890 --> 09:03.820
Even if I wanted to die, I couldn't.

09:04.550 --> 09:07.430
I'm also not strong like humans are.

09:07.430 --> 09:10.300
I couldn't just forget about you either.

09:11.180 --> 09:13.820
So what was I supposed to do?

09:14.380 --> 09:15.670
That's...

09:17.930 --> 09:20.660
I'm sorry, that was mean.

09:20.660 --> 09:24.070
There's no way you could 
answer when I ask like that.

09:24.510 --> 09:26.640
But it's okay, Shin.

09:26.640 --> 09:28.250
Leave it to me.

09:28.250 --> 09:29.210
Mio?

09:31.640 --> 09:33.660
Time for the finishing touches.

09:33.660 --> 09:38.640
I'll leave your memories as Shin 
and erase all your other memories.

09:38.640 --> 09:42.470
Then you'll be restored to Shin 
just as I've been restored to Mio.

09:43.740 --> 09:46.350
Thank you for everything until now, Shido.

09:46.350 --> 09:49.100
Shido!

09:50.360 --> 09:51.610
Tohka!

09:52.330 --> 09:54.400
Sorry I'm late, Shido!

09:54.400 --> 09:56.320
We heard the story over the intercom.

09:56.320 --> 09:58.240
Is that really Reine?

09:58.240 --> 10:02.850
Alert. She's also the Spirit 
of Origin and Phantom,

10:02.850 --> 10:04.490
so she's being too greedy.

10:07.870 --> 10:08.620
Shido!

10:10.230 --> 10:13.750
Wait a little bit for me, Shin.

10:15.260 --> 10:16.010
Shido!

10:16.420 --> 10:18.010
Where did you send Shido?!

10:18.400 --> 10:20.330
Somewhere safe.

10:20.330 --> 10:23.170
That way he won't get caught up in our battle.

10:34.220 --> 10:36.380
Yamabuki?! Why are you here?!

10:36.380 --> 10:38.400
That's our line!

10:38.400 --> 10:41.080
Itsuka, where did you come from?!

10:41.080 --> 10:43.500
Were you clinging to the ceiling 
to go after Ai?!

10:43.500 --> 10:46.860
Hey, is Tohka not enough for you?!

10:46.860 --> 10:48.210
That's so lame!

10:48.210 --> 10:49.000
Huh?

10:49.000 --> 10:51.210
Is this the spatial quake shelter?

10:51.210 --> 10:54.130
Why are you stating the obvious? 
Now move, you're scaring me!

10:54.130 --> 10:54.910
Yamabuki!

10:55.420 --> 10:56.710
Wh-What is it?!

10:57.010 --> 10:58.710
Which shelter is this?!

10:58.710 --> 10:59.780
Which one?

10:59.780 --> 11:01.970
Obviously it's the one beneath the school.

11:01.970 --> 11:03.370
The school...

11:03.370 --> 11:04.440
I see.

11:04.440 --> 11:08.100
That's a pretty long distance 
from where I previously was.

11:08.480 --> 11:11.620
Sorry, everyone, but let me through!

11:11.620 --> 11:12.900
I have to go!

11:13.360 --> 11:16.610
You idiot! 
The warning hasn't been lifted yet!

11:16.610 --> 11:19.270
Where do you even plan on going?

11:19.270 --> 11:21.410
I have to go.

11:21.410 --> 11:23.330
To where Tohka and Origami are!

11:23.330 --> 11:23.990
Huh?

11:23.990 --> 11:26.460
Oh, so that's what's up.

11:26.460 --> 11:28.960
I haven't seen them in a while, yeah.

11:28.960 --> 11:31.780
I just thought they were 
in a different shelter.

11:32.870 --> 11:34.630
Got her!

11:35.050 --> 11:37.750
H-Hey you four, what are you doing?!

11:37.750 --> 11:39.500
T-Tonomachi!

11:39.500 --> 11:42.380
Yamabuki, Hazakura, Fujibakama!

11:42.730 --> 11:44.420
Hurry up and go!

11:44.420 --> 11:46.540
Those two are still stuck outside, right?

11:46.540 --> 11:49.290
You can thank us for today
with lunch tomorrow!

11:49.290 --> 11:50.640
That's so lame.

11:50.640 --> 11:53.150
Give us a chance to look cool now and then.

11:51.650 --> 11:53.980
Hey, let go of me already!

11:53.980 --> 11:56.860
Sensei, this is a good moment!

11:55.070 --> 11:57.810
What are you all doing, jeez?!

11:56.860 --> 11:59.280
Go a little easier on me, please!

11:59.660 --> 12:01.980
Everyone, thank you!

12:02.810 --> 12:05.060
Hey! You can't do it, Itsuka!

12:05.060 --> 12:08.660
The door won't open 
until the warning is lifted!

12:13.070 --> 12:13.950
Michael!

12:16.420 --> 12:17.790
Lataib!

12:18.800 --> 12:20.900
Whoa!

12:22.940 --> 12:24.800
That's so lame.

12:27.250 --> 12:27.980
Mio.

12:28.710 --> 12:30.860
You are Reine, right?

12:30.860 --> 12:34.060
Yeah, that's right, Tohka.

12:34.370 --> 12:36.730
Are you sure you won't reconsider?

12:36.730 --> 12:38.980
You've done a lot for us.

12:38.980 --> 12:40.940
I'd rather not fight you if we don't have to.

12:43.950 --> 12:45.440
I see.

12:45.440 --> 12:46.700
That's a shame.

12:49.450 --> 12:50.450
Hey!

12:50.450 --> 12:55.710
What are you doing ignoring us and 
acting like the final battle is starting?!

12:56.090 --> 12:58.380
Seriously, this is outlandish!

13:04.150 --> 13:05.880
Ein Sof Ohr.

13:08.380 --> 13:09.070
Huh?

13:09.540 --> 13:11.140
What's this?

13:11.850 --> 13:13.140
Blossom.

13:35.620 --> 13:37.520
The Bandersnatch squad is wiped out!

13:37.520 --> 13:39.840
Nibeelcole has vanished and can't reform!

13:40.130 --> 13:43.180
Ship 3, Galdrabok, is unable 
to maintain its Territory!

13:43.180 --> 13:43.960
It's going down!

13:51.190 --> 13:54.600
So you've finally appeared, Deus!

13:55.000 --> 13:57.310
My beloved Spirit!

14:03.400 --> 14:06.570
I really do feel sorry toward all of you.

14:07.200 --> 14:10.630
That's why I won't tell you not to fight back.

14:11.190 --> 14:14.170
Because that's a natural right you all have.

14:15.130 --> 14:17.730
Now, come at me,

14:18.260 --> 14:20.880
my cute daughters.

14:33.410 --> 14:34.760
Here, here!

14:37.210 --> 14:39.770
Origami, are you all right?!

14:39.770 --> 14:42.980
Hmm, looks like your plan worked.

14:44.950 --> 14:47.640
You're the one who took out Artemisia, yeah?

14:47.640 --> 14:51.740
It surprised me when I saw a key suddenly 
thrust in from out of nowhere.

14:52.140 --> 14:53.120
Hmm?

14:53.120 --> 14:55.870
U-Um, uh...

14:57.630 --> 15:01.410
Seeing you this up close, 
you really are a normal girl, huh?

15:01.870 --> 15:06.420
Makes me wonder where they got that talk of 
enemy lifeforms incapable of communication.

15:09.260 --> 15:10.380
A bombardment?

15:10.380 --> 15:11.510
Origami!

15:16.970 --> 15:18.020
Defensive formation!

15:23.520 --> 15:25.150
You can't! Run!

15:29.290 --> 15:30.210
Huh?

15:34.970 --> 15:35.830
Hey!

15:35.830 --> 15:37.040
Mike!

15:38.070 --> 15:40.540
What's going on? She's dead?

15:42.040 --> 15:45.540
That should be where Master 
and the others were fighting!

15:45.540 --> 15:46.710
Let's go!

15:47.560 --> 15:49.850
Captain, please take care 
of Mike and the rest.

15:50.310 --> 15:52.220
If you take them to Fraxinus' medical facility,

15:52.220 --> 15:53.930
it might be possible to resuscitate them.

15:53.930 --> 15:55.430
Fraxinus?

15:55.870 --> 15:58.500
The flagship currently fighting DEM.

15:59.010 --> 16:01.060
We're going to aid Shido and the others!

16:06.980 --> 16:08.970
What incredible magic capacity.

16:09.390 --> 16:11.570
Though your attacks are too direct.

16:12.590 --> 16:15.920
I know you're happy 
for our long awaited reunion,

16:15.920 --> 16:18.200
but settle down a bit, Ellen.

16:18.630 --> 16:20.850
I see you're still making 
yourself look younger.

16:21.430 --> 16:24.960
Well, not that I'm one to talk right now.

16:24.960 --> 16:25.790
Shut up!

16:28.210 --> 16:29.160
Why?!

16:29.160 --> 16:32.500
Why did you betray us, Elliot?!

16:32.500 --> 16:36.180
We had vowed to each other that 
we would get our retaliation,

16:36.180 --> 16:39.850
our revenge, our retribution 
against all of mankind!

16:43.230 --> 16:46.450
You turned your back on our vows!

16:46.450 --> 16:49.240
You seduced my little sister, 
stole the fruits of our research,

16:49.240 --> 16:51.210
and became our enemy!

16:51.210 --> 16:54.490
Know that you will pay 
for that sin with your death!

16:54.910 --> 16:57.740
I do feel bad for you and Ike.

16:58.130 --> 17:01.750
Well, I wouldn't say I seduced Karen,

17:01.750 --> 17:06.100
but before I knew it she had 
arranged her matters to be at my side.

17:06.830 --> 17:11.230
Regardless, I never wanted to be your enemy.

17:11.730 --> 17:16.130
It's just that the path I chose collided 
with the path you two chose in a weird way.

17:16.130 --> 17:17.140
Nonsense!

17:17.750 --> 17:22.690
I still haven't forgotten the resentment 
I feel for our village being burned down,

17:22.690 --> 17:24.420
or the hatred I feel for our comrades' murder.

17:25.330 --> 17:26.330
I just...

17:28.380 --> 17:30.710
Have you noticed it, too, Ellen?

17:31.330 --> 17:33.530
This incredible spirit power.

17:33.880 --> 17:34.830
Deus!

17:35.500 --> 17:36.520
Yeah.

17:36.520 --> 17:37.590
There's no mistaking it.

17:38.300 --> 17:42.710
When I first saw that Spirit, I thought,

17:44.030 --> 17:47.230
"Ahh, how pretty."

17:48.660 --> 17:55.930
Then, "Is it okay to sacrifice such an 
innocent child for the sake of our revenge?"

17:56.650 --> 18:00.180
I thought, "If we do, then how 
are we any different from the humans

18:00.180 --> 18:02.560
who burned down our home?"

18:03.810 --> 18:07.590
You've always been pure and direct.

18:08.430 --> 18:10.470
The most so of all three of us.

18:11.350 --> 18:15.690
So I'm sure we're the two who changed.

18:18.540 --> 18:22.970
But I still consider you 
and Ike to be my friends.

18:23.700 --> 18:25.270
That will never change.

18:26.070 --> 18:28.210
I'm sure Karen feels the same way, too.

18:28.560 --> 18:29.710
What are you-?!

18:44.250 --> 18:46.620
If you can't forgive me, then that's fine.

18:47.420 --> 18:49.850
But at least give Karen another chance—

18:49.850 --> 18:50.940
Chastiefol!

18:54.850 --> 18:57.390
Pierce him, Rhongomiant!

18:58.140 --> 18:59.260
Gungnir!

19:19.690 --> 19:22.470
Kaguya, Yuzuru, are you ready?

19:22.470 --> 19:25.680
Wh-Who do you think you're talking to?!

19:25.680 --> 19:27.500
I'm perfectly good to go!

19:27.500 --> 19:30.560
Agreed. No matter how powerful our foe,

19:30.560 --> 19:32.980
a Yamai will never back down.

19:33.280 --> 19:34.110
Good!

19:46.030 --> 19:49.540
Tohka, you won't be able 
to defeat me like that.

19:49.540 --> 19:51.750
Yeah, I'm sure I won't.

19:55.100 --> 19:56.340
Raphael!

19:56.340 --> 19:58.300
Yes! El Kanaf!

20:06.000 --> 20:08.310
A splendid surprise attack. However-

20:09.810 --> 20:11.220
Sandalphon!

20:11.220 --> 20:12.770
Halvanhelv!

20:34.580 --> 20:36.040
Kaguya, behind you!

20:36.040 --> 20:36.670
Huh?!

20:42.540 --> 20:44.750
Ah? Huh?

20:52.380 --> 20:53.700
K-Kaguya!

20:55.100 --> 20:57.370
Yuzu...

20:59.070 --> 21:00.330
K-Kaguya!

21:00.330 --> 21:02.190
Kaguya, Kaguya!

21:02.630 --> 21:05.880
Hang in there, Kaguya!

21:05.880 --> 21:08.510
Kaguya! Kaguya!

21:12.650 --> 21:14.210
Please let me make it in time!

21:26.280 --> 21:27.390
What?

21:27.390 --> 21:29.470
What's happening here?!

21:41.020 --> 21:43.740
Now then, Shido Itsuka.

21:44.210 --> 21:46.660
Let's decide here and now

21:46.660 --> 21:52.150
which of us is fit 
to obtain the Spirits' power.

21:52.740 --> 21:55.000
<b>Episode 5</b>

21:52.740 --> 21:55.000
<b>Mother Mio</b>

23:25.000 --> 23:40.020
Episode 6 "The Three Magi"

23:26.050 --> 23:29.130
A cruel fate assails 
the young Westcott and others.

23:29.420 --> 23:33.640
However, a suspicious smile forms on his lips.

23:33.640 --> 23:36.720
Next episode is Episode 6: 
The Three Magi.


23:37.160 --> 23:39.270
This is where it all began.
